*
!*/
!.gitignore
!**/*.lin
!**/*.rulel
!**/*.lin-cert
!**/*.py
!verify_linvm0.sh
!compiler/**
!Makefile
!build.zig
!AGENTS.md
!GEMINI.md
!CLAUDE.md
!.cursorrules
!README.md
!TESTS.md
!SECURITY_AUDIT.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE.rulel
!docs/**
!test/**
!transpile/**
!examples/**
!stubs/**
!redteam/**
!benchmarks/**
!test_lin_full_self_hosted_suite.zig
!test_lin_selfhost_compat_001.zig
!.github/**
!**/*.yml
!**/*.yaml

bin/**
bin/lin_native
*.o
*.a
*.a.o
zig-cache/
.zig-cache/
zig-out/
repos/
*.key

# Attestation runtime artifacts — produced by `lin` at run time, never evidence,
# never committed.
simulated_attestations.log
witness_roster.rulel
*_receipt.rulel
*_report.rulel
audit_report.rulel
conformance_report.rulel
verification_api_response.json
# Build artifacts of the C port (the sources are tracked, the binaries are not).
transpile/c/bin/
# Private Ed25519 seeds for the LIN Gate must never be committed; only the
# public roster (lin_gate_roster.rulel) is a repository artifact.
*.seed
lin_gate_key*

# artefatos de python — o gate usa python3 como verificador independente; os
# .py de teste são rastreados (!**/*.py), mas o cache de import não deve ser
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# artefatos da auditoria de seguranca de 2026-09-01 (PDF + issues geradas + scripts)
!docs/security-audit/*.pdf
!docs/security-audit/*.py
!docs/security-audit/issues/
!docs/security-audit/issues/*.md
# graficos intermediarios do relatorio (regerados a cada execucao)
docs/security-audit/_chart_*.png
